#!/bin/sh
# tidex-env COMMAND...: run COMMAND in the project's Python env (tidex-python), activated as micromamba/conda
# would (activation scripts too, e.g. GDAL_DATA), or as a virtualenv; as is when none is chosen.
p=$(cat "$(tidex-state 2>/dev/null)/python" 2>/dev/null)
if [ -d "$p/conda-meta" ]; then
  if command -v micromamba >/dev/null; then eval "$(micromamba shell activate -s posix -p "$p")"
  elif command -v conda >/dev/null; then eval "$(conda shell.posix activate "$p")"
  else PATH=$p/bin:$PATH CONDA_PREFIX=$p; export PATH CONDA_PREFIX
  fi
elif [ -x "$p/bin/python" ]; then
  VIRTUAL_ENV=$p PATH=$p/bin:$PATH; export VIRTUAL_ENV PATH
fi
exec "$@"
